-- High-Risk call board quests: the High-Risk dailies and weeklies handed out and taken back at the Hero's Call
-- Board (402000) and the Warchief's Command Board (402001), in the board's High-Risk category (QuestSortID -383).
-- Source: AscensionDB archive (hertigservices.github.io/ascension-data) revision d6494ceb3150, built 2026-09-12:
-- questcache Client captures for quest_template. The archive carries no quest relations; the boards are the givers
-- because the quests' completion text reads "Return to the call board." The High-Risk aura gate follows the
-- quests' own titles, and the faction split follows "For The Alliance", "Alliance Expedition" and "For The Horde".
-- Held back from the capture: the 50015-51019 copies of the 8200xxx quests, the one-time 420451-420457 copies of
-- the weekly quests 1228-1234, 420461 (no title) and 982019 (a Legion quest, not a call board quest).
-- The daily and weekly quests are marked repeatable in the addon table.
-- A board lists a few of the daily and weekly quests at a time through quest pools that change at the resets.

